From: warelik <warelik@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:43:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] Add bundled Mono Light theme

Mono Light is a flat light theme for the borderless layout of this fork.
The border colours of panes, panels and elements are transparent, and
the editor, panels, tab bar, toolbar, terminal and status bar share one
surface colour (#F1F0EF), so areas are told apart by spacing and by the
hover and selection fill (#E2E1DE) instead of by lines. The scrollbar
thumb is transparent in every state; the minimap thumb keeps a
translucent fill so the visible range stays readable.

The theme is only bundled. It shows up in the theme picker and can be
chosen with "theme": "Mono Light"; the default theme does not change.
---
 assets/themes/mono/mono.json | 99 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 99 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 assets/themes/mono/mono.json

